        <span class="dw-repo-badge">官方标准</span>
      </div>
      <div class="dw-repo-desc">Milvus 官方文档：如何利用物理分区进行内存段修剪，极大提高超大规模向量的检索能效。</div>
    </a>`
  },
  'deadlock': {
    icon: '🔁', title: 'Agent 循环死锁防范',
    deep_principle: `<p><strong>📐 状态机鲁棒性控制与死循环拦截</strong>（参考 Datawhale hello-agents）：在 Multi-Agent 协作网络中，Agent 会依据 LLM 输出进行自决策，并在失败时尝试纠错。如果工具的返回包含噪声或 LLM 对异常返回（如数据库超时）理解产生幻觉，就会产生死锁：LLM 试图重试同一参数的同一个工具。hello-agents 针对状态漂移（State Drift）与死循环拦截提供了权威的防范方案。</p>
    <a class="dw-repo-card" href="https://github.com/datawhalechina/hello-agents" target="_blank">
      <div class="dw-repo-header">
        <span class="dw-repo-title">📦 datawhalechina / hello-agents</span>
        <span class="dw-repo-badge">Datawhale 官方推荐</span>
      </div>
      <div class="dw-repo-desc">全网最火的 Agent 交互原理与架构实战，教你如何用极简状态机实现极致鲁棒性控制。</div>
      <div class="dw-repo-footer">
        <span>⭐ Star 6.8k+</span>
        <span>智能体鲁棒性</span>
      </div>
    </a>`,
    metaphor: '<div class="drawer-metaphor"><strong>👨‍🏫 走迷宫带本子和步数计数器</strong><br><br>你派机器人（Agent）去迷宫（业务系统）里查物流状态。<br><br><strong>死循环的发生</strong>：机器人来到第一个路口，看到"查物流"工具点了一下。工具返回"由于天气延迟，物流更新失败"。机器人脑子比较轴（LLM 规划局限），心想"我还是得知道物流啊，再试试"。于是又点了一遍，工具又返回失败…如果不加限制，它会<strong>无限重复点这个按钮</strong>，直到 Token 彻底烧光或自己卡死。<br><br><strong>防范方案</strong>：给机器人塞一个<strong>"备忘录本子（路径哈希）"</strong>和一个<strong>"步数计数器（tool_loop_counter）"</strong>。每次按按钮都在本子上记"用参数 [MAT-001] 按了 [查物流] 按钮"。点下一个按钮前翻翻本子——如果发现"已经用一模一样的动作按了 3 轮了"或"总共按了 5 次按钮（MAX_ITERATIONS）了"——立刻拉警报，放弃尝试，走安全通道出来老实报告"主人，这个按钮坏了，试了 5 次都不行，咱们别试了"。</div>',
    principle: '<p>多 Agent 在 ReAct 循环中，极易因 LLM 对工具返回的错误信息解析产生偏差，从而陷入"LLM 决策→产生 tool_call→节点执行报错→LLM 再次同样决策"的环状依赖死锁。</p><p><strong>三层主动死锁检测</strong>：</p><ol style="padding-left:18px;"><li><strong>状态字段注入</strong>：AgentState 中声明 tool_loop_counter 和 action_path_history。</li><li><strong>条件边监测</strong>：每次执行完 async_tool_node 后计算 action_signature = sha256(tool_name + str(tool_args))。</li><li><strong>断路器熔断</strong>：检测到 state["action_path_history"].count(signature) >= 3 或 tool_loop_counter >= 5 → 强制绕过 agent_node 跳转 safety_handler 兜底节点，输出友好终止提示。</li></ol><p>SmartQA 的 ToolAgent 已在 run() 中实现 iteration >= MAX_ITERATIONS 时自动终止。</p>',
    refs: `<a class="dw-repo-card" href="https://github.com/datawhalechina/hello-agents" target="_blank">
      <div class="dw-repo-header">
        <span class="dw-repo-title">📦 datawhalechina / hello-agents</span>
        <span class="dw-repo-badge">Datawhale 官方推荐</span>
      </div>
      <div class="dw-repo-desc">全网最火的 Agent 交互原理与架构实战，教你如何用极简状态机实现极致鲁棒性控制。</div>
    </a>
    <a class="dw-repo-card" href="https://langchainai.github.io/langgraph/concepts/low_level/" target="_blank">
      <div class="dw-repo-header">
        <span class="dw-repo-title">📘 LangGraph 官方状态机制</span>
        <span class="dw-repo-badge">官方标准</span>
      </div>
      <div class="dw-repo-desc">LangGraph low-level 概念文档：深入解析 Memory、States 以及 Recursion Limits 如何约束图遍历的最大步数。</div>
    </a>`
  }
};，提前通知前端</span>
        <span class="kw">if</span> settings.DEMO_MODE:
            <span class="kw">yield</span> <span class="call">_sse_format</span>({<span class="str">"type"</span>:<span class="str">"demo_mode"</span>,...})

        <span class="cm"># 1. 发送会话 ID</span>
        <span class="kw">yield</span> <span class="call">_sse_format</span>({<span class="str">"type"</span>:<span class="str">"session"</span>,<span class="str">"session_id"</span>:session_id})

        <span class="cm"># 2. Query Cache 检查（MD5 匹配，零 token 重放）</span>
        cache_key = <span class="fn">f</span><span class="str">"query_cache:{md5(query)}"</span>
        cached = <span class="kw">await</span> redis.<span class="call">get</span>(cache_key)
        <span class="kw">if</span> cached:
            <span class="kw">yield</span> cached_answer
            <span class="kw">return</span>  <span class="cm"># 缓存命中，直接返回</span>

        <span class="cm"># 3. 意图路由（三级级联：规则 → 语义 → LLM）</span>
        route_result = <span class="kw">await</span> router_agent.<span class="call">route</span>(safe_query)
        intent = route_result[<span class="str">"intent"</span>]
        <span class="kw">yield</span> <span class="call">_sse_format</span>({<span class="str">"type"</span>:<span class="str">"route"</span>,<span class="str">"intent"</span>:intent.value,...})

        <span class="cm"># 4. 按意图分发到不同 Agent 链路</span>
        <span class="kw">if</span>   intent == GREETING:   <span class="cm"># 直接回复问候</span>
        <span class="kw">elif</span> intent == RAG_ANSWER: <span class="cm"># 混合检索→Reranker→LLM 生成→SSE 推送</span>
        <span class="kw">elif</span> intent == TOOL_CALL:  <span class="cm"># 澄清检查→权限检查→ReAct 循环→SSE 推送</span>
        <span class="kw">elif</span> intent == GOAL:       <span class="cm"># Orchestrator Plan→Execute→Summarize</span>
        <span class="kw">elif</span> intent == HYBRID:     <span class="cm"># RAG 增强→Tool 调用</span>
        <span class="kw">elif</span> intent == GRAPH_QUERY:<span class="cm"># Neo4j 图检索</span>
        <span class="kw">elif</span> intent == UNCLEAR:    <span class="cm"># RAG 检索兜底</span>

        <span class="cm"># 5. 保存对话记忆到 Redis（session 级别上下文）</span>
        <span class="kw">await</span> chat_memory.<span class="call">add_message</span>(session_id, <span class="str">"user"</span>, query)
        <span class="kw">await</span> chat_memory.<span class="call">add_message</span>(session_id, <span class="str">"assistant"</span>, answer)

    <span class="kw">return</span> <span class="call">StreamingResponse</span>(
        <span class="call">event_generator</span>(),
        media_type=<span class="str">"text/event-stream"</span>,
        headers={<span class="str">"Cache-Control"</span>:<span class="str">"no-cache"</span>,<span class="str">"X-Accel-Buffering"</span>:<span class="str">"no"</span>}
    )`,
  router: `<span class="cm"># backend/app/agents/router.py — 三级意图路由</span>
<span class="kw">async def</span> <span class="fn">route</span>(self, query: <span class="fn">str</span>) -> <span class="fn">dict</span>:
    <span class="cm">"""路由用户查询到对应 Agent — 三级级联"""</span>

    <span class="cm"># ---- Step 1: 规则匹配 (&lt;1ms, 零 Token) ----</span>
    rule_result = self.<span class="call">_rule_match</span>(query)
    <span class="kw">if</span> rule_result:
        <span class="kw">return</span> rule_result  <span class="cm"># 直接返回：method="rule"</span>

    <span class="cm"># ---- Step 2: 语义路由 (&lt;10ms, 零 Token) ----</span>
    <span class="call">_ensure_semantic_router</span>()  <span class="cm"># 延迟初始化 embedding</span>
    <span class="kw">if</span> _semantic_ready:
        query_emb = rag_engine.embedding.<span class="call">embed_query</span>(query)
        semantic_result = semantic_router.<span class="call">route</span>(query_emb)
        <span class="kw">if</span> semantic_result:
            <span class="kw">return</span> {<span class="str">"method"</span>:<span class="str">"semantic"</span>, <span class="str">"confidence"</span>:semantic_result.confidence}

    <span class="cm"># ---- Step 3: LLM 分类 (~2.5s, 兜底) ----</span>
    <span class="kw">return await</span> self.<span class="call">_llm_classify</span>(query)

<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">_rule_match</span>(self, query: <span class="fn">str</span>):
    <span class="cm">"""规则匹配：基于关键词和正则的快速路由"""</span>
    <span class="cm"># 1. 问候匹配（仅短 query 且无业务关键词）→ GREETING</span>
    <span class="cm"># 2. 工具关键词优先（精确匹配 > 模糊匹配）→ TOOL_CALL</span>
    <span class="cm"># 3. 图谱检索关键词（含 MAT-/PO- 编码 + 关联意图词）→ GRAPH_QUERY</span>
    <span class="cm"># 4. 目标型关键词（帮我评估/帮我分析/怎么办）→ GOAL</span>
    <span class="cm"># 5. RAG 关键词匹配（什么是/怎么理解/原理）→ RAG_ANSWER</span>
    <span class="kw">return None</span>  <span class="cm"># 规则未命中 → 走 Step 2 语义路由 → Step 3 LLM</span>`,
  rag: `<span class="cm"># backend/app/core/rag_engine.py — 混合检索引擎</span>
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">search</span>(self, query, top_k=<span class="num">3</span>, visibility_expr=<span class="str">""</span>):
    <span class="cm">"""混合检索：向量 + BM25 + Reranker 精排"""</span>

    <span class="cm"># 0. Query Cache（相同 query 直接返回，TTL=300s）</span>
    <span class="kw">if</span> cache_key <span class="kw">in</span> self._query_cache:
        <span class="kw">return</span> cached_result

    <span class="cm"># 1. 向量检索（Milvus，top_k=20，gRPC 失败自动重试 3 次）</span>
    query_embedding = self.embedding.<span class="call">embed_query</span>(query)
    vector_results = milvus_manager.<span class="call">search</span>(
        query_embedding=query_embedding,
        top_k=settings.VECTOR_TOP_K,  <span class="cm"># = 20</span>
        expr=visibility_expr
    )

    <span class="cm"># 2. BM25 关键词检索（rank_bm25，top_k=20）</span>
    bm25_results = self.bm25.<span class="call">search</span>(
        query,
        top_k=settings.BM25_TOP_K,  <span class="cm"># = 20</span>
        allowed_roles=roles_from_visibility_expr
    )

    <span class="cm"># 3. RRF 融合（K=60, 自适应权重）</span>
    merged = self.<span class="call">_merge_results</span>(
        vector_results, bm25_results, query=query
    )
    <span class="cm"># _merge_results 内部：</span>
    <span class="cm">#   - 精确查询(含编码/数字) → BM25 权重 ×1.5</span>
    <span class="cm">#   - 语义查询(含怎么/如何) → 向量权重 ×1.5</span>
    <span class="cm">#   - 低分过滤(min_rrf=0.008) + Jaccard 去重(>0.7)</span>

    <span class="cm"># 4. Reranker 精排（CrossEncoder BGE-Reranker-v2-m3, top_k=3）</span>
    <span class="kw">if</span> settings.RERANKER_ENABLED:
        reranked = self.reranker.<span class="call">rerank</span>(
            query, merged[:settings.RERANK_TOP_K * <span class="num">2</span>],
            top_k=settings.RERANK_TOP_K  <span class="cm"># = 3</span>
        )
    <span class="kw">else</span>:
        <span class="cm"># 降级：按原始检索分数排序</span>
        reranked = <span class="fn">sorted</span>(merged, key=score)[:top_k]

    <span class="cm"># 5. 冲突检测 + 置信度计算（sigmoid 映射）</span>
    conflicts = <span class="call">_detect_conflicts</span>(reranked)  <span class="cm"># 同实体不同数值标记</span>
    confidence = <span class="call">_calculate_confidence</span>(reranked)

    <span class="kw">return</span> {
        <span class="str">"results"</span>: reranked,
        <span class="str">"confidence"</span>: confidence,
        <span class="str">"conflicts"</span>: conflicts,
        <span class="str">"retrieval_method"</span>: <span class="str">"hybrid_reranked"</span>
    }`,
  tool: `<span class="cm"># backend/app/agents/tool.py — LangGraph StateGraph ReAct Agent（约 220 行）</span>
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">_build_graph</span>(self):
    <span class="cm">"""构建 LangGraph 状态图 — 自定义 async 工具执行节点"""</span>
    raw_tools = self.tools  <span class="cm"># 6 个 BaseTool: query_inventory/query_order/...</span>
    tools_by_name = {t.name: t <span class="kw">for</span> t <span class="kw">in</span> raw_tools}
    llm_with_tools = LLMFactory.<span class="call">get_llm</span>(t=<span class="num">0</span>).<span class="call">bind_tools</span>(raw_tools)

    <span class="kw">async def</span> <span class="fn">agent_node</span>(state: AgentState) -> <span class="fn">dict</span>:
        <span class="cm">"""LLM 决策节点 → 输出 AIMessage(可能含 tool_calls)"""</span>
        messages = state[<span class="str">"messages"</span>]
        <span class="kw">if not</span> <span class="fn">any</span>(<span class="fn">isinstance</span>(m, SystemMessage) <span class="kw">for</span> m <span class="kw">in</span> messages):
            messages = [<span class="call">SystemMessage</span>(SYSTEM_PROMPT)] + <span class="fn">list</span>(messages)
        response = <span class="kw">await</span> llm_with_tools.<span class="call">ainvoke</span>(messages)
        <span class="kw">return</span> {<span class="str">"messages"</span>: [response]}

    <span class="kw">async def</span> <span class="fn">async_tool_node</span>(state: AgentState) -> <span class="fn">dict</span>:
        <span class="cm">"""自定义工具执行节点 — 直接调 tool.ainvoke()，替代 LangGraph 内置 ToolNode"""</span>
        last_msg = state[<span class="str">"messages"</span>][<span class="num">-1</span>]
        <span class="kw">if not</span> <span class="fn">hasattr</span>(last_msg, <span class="str">"tool_calls"</span>) <span class="kw">or not</span> last_msg.tool_calls:
            <span class="kw">return</span> {<span class="str">"messages"</span>: []}

        tool_messages = []
        <span class="kw">for</span> tc <span class="kw">in</span> last_msg.tool_calls:
            tool = tools_by_name.<span class="call">get</span>(tc[<span class="str">"name"</span>])
            <span class="kw">try</span>:
                <span class="cm"># 直接调用 ainvoke()，记录指标</span>
                result = <span class="kw">await</span> tool.<span class="call">ainvoke</span>(tc[<span class="str">"args"</span>])
                tool_metrics.<span class="call">record</span>(name, args, result, t, <span class="kw">True</span>)
            <span class="kw">except</span> Exception <span class="kw">as</span> e:
                result = <span class="fn">f</span><span class="str">"工具执行失败: {e}"</span>
                tool_metrics.<span class="call">record</span>(name, args, <span class="fn">str</span>(e), <span class="num">0</span>, <span class="kw">False</span>)
            tool_messages.<span class="call">append</span>(<span class="call">ToolMessage</span>(content=result, ...))
        <span class="kw">return</span> {<span class="str">"messages"</span>: tool_messages}

    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">route_after_agent</span>(state):
        <span class="cm">"""条件边：有 tool_calls → tools 节点，否则 → END"""</span>
        <span class="kw">return</span> <span class="str">"tools"</span> <span class="kw">if</span> state[<span class="str">"messages"</span>][<span class="num">-1</span>].tool_calls <span class="kw">else</span> END

    <span class="cm"># 构建图：START → agent ⇄ tools → END</span>
    builder = <span class="call">StateGraph</span>(AgentState)
    builder.<span class="call">add_node</span>(<span class="str">"agent"</span>, agent_node)
    builder.<span class="call">add_node</span>(<span class="str">"tools"</span>, async_tool_node)
    builder.<span class="call">add_edge</span>(START, <span class="str">"agent"</span>)
    builder.<span class="call">add_conditional_edges</span>(<span class="str">"agent"</span>, route_after_agent)
    builder.<span class="call">add_edge</span>(<span class="str">"tools"</span>, <span class="str">"agent"</span>)  <span class="cm"># 循环回 agent</span>
    <span class="kw">return</span> builder.<span class="call">compile</span>()

<span class="cm"># ---- Orchestrator (orchestrator.py) ----</span>
<span class="kw">async def</span> <span class="fn">run</span>(self, goal, session_id, user_id):
    <span class="cm">"""Plan → Execute → Summarize 三阶段跨域编排"""</span>
    <span class="cm"># 1. Plan: LLM 拆解用户目标为 JSON 执行步骤</span>
    plan = <span class="kw">await</span> self.<span class="call">plan</span>(goal)
    steps = plan.<span class="call">get</span>(<span class="str">"steps"</span>, [])
    <span class="cm"># DEMO_MODE 降级: LLM 不可用时返回 _demo_plan() 本地模板</span>

    <span class="cm"># 2. Execute: 顺序调专域 Agent，每步结果注入下一步 context</span>
    execution = <span class="kw">await</span> self.<span class="call">execute</span>(
        goal=plan.<span class="call">get</span>(<span class="str">"goal"</span>, goal),
        steps=steps, session_id=session_id, user_id=user_id
    )

    <span class="cm"># 3. Summarize: ≤3 步模板拼接，≥4 步 LLM 汇总</span>
    summary = <span class="kw">await</span> self.<span class="call">summarize</span>(
        goal=plan.<span class="call">get</span>(<span class="str">"goal"</span>, goal),
        step_results=execution[<span class="str">"step_results"</span>]
    )
    <span class="kw">return</span> {<span class="str">"answer"</span>:summary, <span class="str">"plan"</span>:plan, <span class="str">"execution"</span>:execution}`
};

function openIdePanel(fileName) {
  document.getElementById('ideBody').querySelector('#ideCode').innerHTML =
    SOURCE_CODE_LIBRARY[fileName] || '<span class="cm">// 代码加载中...</span>';
  document.getElementById('idePanel').classList.add('open');
  document.body.classList.add('ide-active');
  document.querySelectorAll('.ide-tab').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
  const activeTab = document.querySelector('.ide-tab[data-file="' + fileName + '"]');
  if (activeTab) activeTab.classList.add('active');

  // 工匠优化：平滑对齐左侧 hotspot 位置，改善对照阅读体验
  const activeEl = document.activeElement;
  if (activeEl && activeEl.closest('.hotspot')) {
    setTimeout(() => {
      activeEl.closest('.hotspot').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
    }, 120);
  }
}

function closeIdePanel() {
  document.getElementById('idePanel').classList.remove('open');
  document.body.classList.remove('ide-active');
}

function copyIdeCode() {
  const codeEl = document.getElementById('ideCode');
  if (!codeEl) return;
  const text = codeEl.innerText;
  navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => {
    alert("📋 代码复制成功！可在你的本地 IDE 中直接粘贴运行。");
  }).catch(err => {
    console.error("复制失败:", err);
    const textarea = document.createElement('textarea');
    textarea.value = text;
    document.body.appendChild(textarea);
    textarea.select();
    try {
      document.execCommand('copy');
      alert("📋 代码复制成功！");
    } catch (e) {
      alert("⚠️ 复制失败，请手动选择复制代码。");
    }
    document.body.removeChild(textarea);
  });
}

function switchIdeTab(fileName) {
  document.getElementById('ideBody').querySelector('#ideCode').innerHTML =
    SOURCE_CODE_LIBRARY[fileName] || '';
  document.querySelectorAll('.ide-tab').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
  const tab = document.querySelector('.ide-tab[data-file="' + fileName + '"]');
  if (tab) tab.classList.add('active');
}

// Keyboard shortcut: Escape to close IDE
document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e) {
  if (e.key === 'Escape' && document.getElementById('idePanel').classList.contains('open')) {
    closeIdePanel();
  }
});

// ========== Glossary Drawer System ==========
const GLOSSARY_DATA = {
  'self-rag': {
    icon: '🔄', title: 'Self-RAG 反思环落地',
    deep_principle: '<p><strong>📐 Pregel 图计算模型</strong>（参考 Datawhale easy-langent）：LangGraph 的 StateGraph 底层依赖于 Pregel 模型。在 Pregel 中每个节点接收上一轮输入、执行计算、向外发送消息，直到图状态不再改变（收敛）。Self-RAG 的 GradeDocuments → rewrite_query → GradeHallucination 正是利用 Pregel 的迭代收敛特性实现的反思环。</p><p><strong>🔗 直达链接：</strong><a href="https://github.com/datawhalechina/easy-langent/wiki/State-Management" target="_blank" style="color:var(--primary);">datawhalechina/easy-langent — 状态管理与图拓扑 Wiki</a></p>',
    metaphor: '<div class="drawer-metaphor"><strong>👨‍🏫 写论文与导师审核</strong><br><br>这就像你在写毕业论文。<br>1. <strong>常规检索</strong>：去图书馆搬回来一堆参考书。<br>2. <strong>GradeDocuments 节点</strong>：翻开书发现大半和课题无关。在 Self-RAG 里你会把无关的书丢掉，<strong>换更精准的搜索词（Query Rewriting）</strong>重新去图书馆找。<br>3. <strong>GradeHallucination 节点</strong>：写完草稿后扮演自己的"严苛导师"，对照参考书逐句核查——"草稿里的数据在参考书里真的能找到出处吗？"。只有全部有出处才交卷；发现有瞎编的立刻打回去重写。<br><br>这就是反思环——不只检索一次，而是不断自我质疑、自我修正。</div>',
    principle: '<p>传统 RAG 是"检索→生成"的单向死胡同。如果检索到的文档是噪声，生成模型也只能"垃圾进，垃圾出"。</p><p><strong>Self-RAG</strong>（出自 2023 年 Akari Asai 等人的经典论文）引入了<strong>"自省标记（Reflection Tokens）"</strong>与<strong>"评估状态机（Evaluator Nodes）"</strong>：</p><ul style="padding-left:18px;"><li><strong>GradeDocuments</strong>：使用轻量分类 Prompt 评估 Query 与 Chunk 相似度。若 80% 的 Chunk 被判为 irrelevant，图的条件边跳转至 rewrite_query 节点，用大模型对原始问题进行同义词扩展和子问题拆解，重新进行 Milvus 向量查询。</li><li><strong>GradeHallucination</strong>：LLM 生成临时 Answer 后，启动无状态自省节点计算 Faithfulness Score——检查 Answer 中的命名实体和事实陈述是否被 Retrieval Context 语义蕴含。未通过则触发重新生成或退回检索层。</li></ul><p>SmartQA 中通过 self_rag.py 在检索结果 ≥4 条时过滤低相关 chunk，Faithfulness checker 在生成后验证。</p>',
    refs: '<a class="ref-link-card" href="https://github.com/datawhalechina/wow-rag" target="_blank"><span class="ref-link-icon">📘</span><div><strong>Datawhale wow-rag</strong><br><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-mid);">进阶 RAG 反思环设计教程</span></div></a><a class="ref-link-card" href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.11511" target="_blank"><span class="ref-link-icon">📄</span><div><strong>Self-RAG 论文原文</strong><br><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-mid);">arXiv:2310.11511 — Learning to Retrieve, Generate, and Self-Reflect</span></div></a>'
  },
  'outbox': {
    icon: '🗄️', title: 'Transactional Outbox 双路同步',
    deep_principle: '<p><strong>📐 向量数据准实时同步</strong>（参考 Datawhale easy-vecdb）：在向量数据库场景下，Embedding 更新不是简单的 KV 覆写——需要重新调用 BGE 模型生成 512 维向量，涉及 GPU/CPU 推理调度。easy-vecdb 的同步教程详细描述了异步消费 + 指数退避重试的工业级实现范式。</p><p><strong>🔗 直达链接：</strong><a href="https://github.com/datawhalechina/easy-vecdb" target="_blank" style="color:var(--primary);">datawhalechina/easy-vecdb — 向量数据准实时同步与更新</a></p>',
    metaphor: '<div class="drawer-metaphor"><strong>👨‍🏫 寄快递的小本子与派送员</strong><br><br>你是仓库管理员，每次改 PostgreSQL 主账本里的库存，都要通知隔壁 Milvus 仓库更新向量。<br><br><strong>笨办法（分布式事务）</strong>：每次改完主账本必须打电话确认 Milvus 也更新完才挂电话。如果隔壁网络不好，整个交易卡死。<br><br><strong>Outbox 模式</strong>：在主账本上加一页<strong>"待发送通知（Outbox 表）"</strong>。改库存的同时在这页写上"更新 MAT-001 向量"。因为两件事写在同一个账本上，绝对绑定（本地事务原子性）。然后有个<strong>快递小哥（后台守护进程 + Redis）</strong>专门盯着这页发件箱——发现新纸条就去给 Milvus 送货。隔壁短暂关门也不怕，小哥会在门口等（重试机制），保证最终两边账目一模一样。</div>',
    principle: '<p>跨 PostgreSQL 和 Milvus 的双写很难使用 2PC——Milvus 不支持分布式事务，且双写会极大延长写 API 的 Latency。</p><p><strong>Transactional Outbox Pattern</strong> 是保证最终一致性的经典工业标准：</p><ol style="padding-left:18px;"><li><strong>原子性写</strong>：FastAPI 收到写请求时，在 PostgreSQL 同一个 db.begin() 事务中同时写入业务表和 outbox 表。</li><li><strong>异步事件驱动</strong>：本地事务提交后，Outbox 监听器（基于 Redis Pub/Sub 或 PG LISTEN/NOTIFY）被触发，或后台守护进程每隔 100ms 扫描 PENDING 行。</li><li><strong>向量化与重试</strong>：消费进程将文本发给 BGE-small-zh-v1.5 模型计算 512 维向量写入 Milvus。失败时基于指数退避算法最多 5 次重试，成功后将 Outbox 状态置为 PROCESSED。</li></ol>',
    refs: '<a class="ref-link-card" href="https://microservices.io/patterns/data/transactional-outbox.html" target="_blank"><span class="ref-link-icon">🏗️</span><div><strong>Microservices.io</strong><br><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-mid);">Transactional Outbox Pattern 经典架构设计</span></div></a><a class="ref-link-card" href="https://github.com/datawhalechina/easy-vecdb" target="_blank"><span class="ref-link-icon">📘</span><div><strong>Datawhale easy-vecdb</strong><br><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-mid);">向量数据准实时同步与更新教程</span></div></a>'
  },
  'partition': {
    icon: '🔐', title: 'Milvus Partition 分区修剪',
    deep_principle: '<p><strong>📐 HNSW 索引原理</strong>（参考 Datawhale easy-vecdb）：Hierarchical Navigable Small World（分层导航小世界）算法。通过构建多层级类似跳表（Skip List）的图结构——在顶层高速粗略导航，在底层精细检索——实现 O(log N) 级的向量检索复杂度。</p><p><strong>📐 标量过滤性能瓶颈</strong>：在 HNSW 图遍历中如果加入标量约束（array_contains），存在两类执行策略：单路先检索再过滤（召回率不足）、双路同时过滤（性能开销极高）。Partition 分区修剪通过在写入时物理隔离向量段，在检索时直接跳过非目标 Partition 的内存段（Segment Pruning），完美绕过标量过滤的性能瓶颈。</p><p><strong>🔗 直达链接：</strong><a href="https://github.com/datawhalechina/easy-vecdb/blob/main/docs/hnsw_scalar_filter.md" target="_blank" style="color:var(--primary);">datawhalechina/easy-vecdb — HNSW 索引与标量混合过滤算法</a></p>',
    metaphor: '<div class="drawer-metaphor"><strong>👨‍🏫 去图书馆分馆借书 vs 用放大镜全馆搜寻</strong><br><br>你是采购员，需要查采购部的保密资料。图书馆有上百万本书。<br><br><strong>笨办法（array_contains 标量过滤）</strong>：所有书胡乱堆在同一个大厅里，每本书贴一行小字"允许：[采购部,仓库部]查看"。图书管理员（Milvus）拿着放大镜把馆里所有相关书籍翻一遍，一行行看那行小字里有没有"采购部"。书多的时候管理员累死，速度极慢。<br><br><strong>物理分区（Partition）</strong>：建图书馆时直接砌墙盖 7 个分馆（采购分馆、仓库分馆、财务分馆…）。查采购资料时，管理员<strong>直接把你带到采购分馆大门里检索</strong>——其他分馆直接被关在门外。管理员连放大镜都不用拿，搜索速度瞬间提升 4-5 倍。</div>',
    principle: '<p>Milvus 在执行混合检索时，HNSW 向量索引只对向量距离敏感。对于 ARRAY 字段，Milvus 无法构建高效标量倒排索引，会导致检索退化为<strong>全 Segment 标量扫描</strong>。</p><p><strong>复合 Partition 优化策略</strong>：</p><ol style="padding-left:18px;"><li><strong>物理分区</strong>：在 Milvus Collection 中显式创建 Partitions，如 partition_purchase、partition_warehouse。</li><li><strong>路由写入</strong>：数据入库时根据文档角色元数据将向量写入对应物理 Partition。</li><li><strong>分区限定检索</strong>：FastAPI 检索时不传复杂 expr，直接传入目标 Partition 列表——Milvus 底层在遍历 HNSW 树前直接剔除所有非目标 Partition 的内存段（Segment Pruning），扫描范围缩减至 1/7。</li></ol>',
    refs: '<a class="ref-link-card" href="https://milvus.io/docs/v2.2.x/partitions.md" target="_blank"><span class="ref-link-icon">📘</span><div><strong>Milvus 官方文档</strong><br><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-mid);">Partitioning vs. Scalar Filtering Performance</span></div></a><a class="ref-link-card" href="https://github.com/datawhalechina/easy-vecdb" target="_blank"><span class="ref-link-icon">📘</span><div><strong>Datawhale easy-vecdb</strong><br><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-mid);">向量检索中的标量过滤与混合搜索</span></div></a>'
  },
  'deadlock': {
    icon: '🔁', title: 'Agent 循环死锁防范',
    deep_principle: '<p><strong>📐 状态机鲁棒性控制</strong>（参考 Datawhale hello-agents）：多 Agent 系统的核心挑战不是单次推理质量，而是在连续多轮交互中的状态漂移（State Drift）。hello-agents 教程详细讨论了工具调用失败、部分成功、超时等异常场景下的状态恢复与断路器熔断策略。</p><p><strong>🔗 直达链接：</strong><a href="https://github.com/datawhalechina/hello-agents" target="_blank" style="color:var(--primary);">datawhalechina/hello-agents — 智能体状态机鲁棒性控制与死循环拦截</a></p><p><strong>🔗 LangGraph 官方：</strong><a href="https://langchainai.github.io/langgraph/concepts/low_level/" target="_blank" style="color:var(--primary);">Memory, States and Recursion Limits</a></p>',
    metaphor: '<div class="drawer-metaphor"><strong>👨‍🏫 走迷宫带本子和步数计数器</strong><br><br>你派机器人（Agent）去迷宫（业务系统）里查物流状态。<br><br><strong>死循环的发生</strong>：机器人来到第一个路口，看到"查物流"工具点了一下。工具返回"由于天气延迟，物流更新失败"。机器人脑子比较轴（LLM 规划局限），心想"我还是得知道物流啊，再试试"。于是又点了一遍，工具又返回失败…如果不加限制，它会<strong>无限重复点这个按钮</strong>，直到 Token 彻底烧光或自己卡死。<br><br><strong>防范方案</strong>：给机器人塞一个<strong>"备忘录本子（路径哈希）"</strong>和一个<strong>"步数计数器（tool_loop_counter）"</strong>。每次按按钮都在本子上记"用参数 [MAT-001] 按了 [查物流] 按钮"。点下一个按钮前翻翻本子——如果发现"已经用一模一样的动作按了 3 轮了"或"总共按了 5 次按钮（MAX_ITERATIONS）了"——立刻拉警报，放弃尝试，走安全通道出来老实报告"主人，这个按钮坏了，试了 5 次都不行，咱们别试了"。</div>',
    principle: '<p>多 Agent 在 ReAct 循环中，极易因 LLM 对工具返回的错误信息解析产生偏差，从而陷入"LLM 决策→产生 tool_call→节点执行报错→LLM 再次同样决策"的环状依赖死锁。</p><p><strong>三层主动死锁检测</strong>：</p><ol style="padding-left:18px;"><li><strong>状态字段注入</strong>：AgentState 中声明 tool_loop_counter 和 action_path_history。</li><li><strong>条件边监测</strong>：每次执行完 async_tool_node 后计算 action_signature = sha256(tool_name + str(tool_args))。</li><li><strong>断路器熔断</strong>：检测到 state["action_path_history"].count(signature) >= 3 或 tool_loop_counter >= 5 → 强制绕过 agent_node 跳转 safety_handler 兜底节点，输出友好终止提示。</li></ol><p>SmartQA 的 ToolAgent 已在 run() 中实现 iteration >= MAX_ITERATIONS 时自动终止。</p>',
    refs: '<a class="ref-link-card" href="https://langchainai.github.io/langgraph/concepts/low_level/" target="_blank"><span class="ref-link-icon">📘</span><div><strong>LangGraph 官方文档</strong><br><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-mid);">Memory, States and Recursion Limits</span></div></a><a class="ref-link-card" href="https://github.com/datawhalechina/hello-agents" target="_blank"><span class="ref-link-icon">📘</span><div><strong>Datawhale hello-agents</strong><br><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-mid);">智能体状态机鲁棒性控制与死循环拦截</span></div></a>'
  }
};

function openGlossary(key) {
  const data = GLOSSARY_DATA[key];
  if (!data) return;
  document.getElementById('drawerIcon').textContent = data.icon;
  document.getElementById('drawerTitle').textContent = data.title;
  document.getElementById('drawerContent').innerHTML =
    '<div class="drawer-content-section active" data-section="metaphor">' + data.metaphor + '</div>' +
    '<div class="drawer-content-section" data-section="principle">' + data.principle + '</div>' +
    '<div class="drawer-content-section" data-section="deep">' + (data.deep_principle || '<p>暂无补充原理资料</p>') + '</div>' +
    '<div class="drawer-content-section" data-section="refs">' + data.refs + '</div>';
  document.getElementById('drawerBackdrop').classList.add('open');
  document.getElementById('drawerPanel').classList.add('open');
  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer-tab').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
  document.querySelector('.drawer-tab[data-tab="metaphor"]').classList.add('active');
}

function closeGlossary() {
  document.getElementById('drawerBackdrop').classList.remove('open');
  document.getElementById('drawerPanel').classList.remove('open');
}

document.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
  if (e.target.closest('.glossary-trigger')) {
    const key = e.target.closest('.glossary-trigger').dataset.glossary;
    openGlossary(key);
  }
  if (e.target.closest('#drawerClose') || e.target === document.getElementById('drawerBackdrop')) {
    closeGlossary();
  }
});

document.getElementById('drawerTabs').addEventListener('click', function(e) {
  if (e.target.classList.contains('drawer-tab')) {
    const tab = e.target.dataset.tab;
    document.querySelectorAll('.drawer-tab').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
    e.target.classList.add('active');
    document.querySelectorAll('.drawer-content-section').forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active'));
    const section = document.querySelector('.drawer-content-section[data-section="' + tab + '"]');
    if (section) section.classList.add('active');
  }
});

function startTimer(){
  timeLeft=90;
  const box=document.getElementById('timerBox');
  box.textContent=timeLeft+'s';
  box.classList.remove('warn');
  clearInterval(timerId);
  timerId=setInterval(()=>{
    timeLeft--;
    box.textContent=timeLeft+'s';
    if(timeLeft<=15)box.classList.add('warn');
    if(timeLeft<=0){clearInterval(timerId);box.textContent='⏰';}
  },1000);
}
</script>


<!-- ===== Split-Screen IDE Panel ===== -->
<div class="ide-panel" id="idePanel">
  <div class="ide-header">
    <div class="ide-tabs">
      <div class="ide-tab active" data-file="chat" onclick="switchIdeTab('chat')"><span class="dot py"></span>chat.py</div>
      <div class="ide-tab" data-file="router" onclick="switchIdeTab('router')"><span class="dot py"></span>router.py</div>
      <div class="ide-tab" data-file="rag" onclick="switchIdeTab('rag')"><span class="dot py"></span>rag_engine.py</div>
      <div class="ide-tab" data-file="tool" onclick="switchIdeTab('tool')"><span class="dot py"></span>tool.py</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;">
      <button class="ide-copy-btn" onclick="copyIdeCode()">📋 复制</button>
      <button class="ide-close" onclick="closeIdePanel()">&times;</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="ide-body" id="ideBody"><pre id="ideCode"></pre></div>
</div>

<!-- ===== Glossary Drawer ===== -->
<div class="drawer-backdrop" id="drawerBackdrop"></div>
<div class="drawer-panel" id="drawerPanel">
  <div class="drawer-header">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
      <span id="drawerIcon" style="font-size:24px;"></span>
      <span id="drawerTitle" style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;"></span>
    </div>
    <button class="drawer-close" id="drawerClose">&times;</button>
  </div>
  <div class="drawer-tabs" id="drawerTabs">
    <button class="drawer-tab active" data-tab="metaphor">🌱 大白话比喻</button>
    <button class="drawer-tab" data-tab="principle">🔬 原理深挖</button>
    <button class="drawer-tab" data-tab="deep">📐 Datawhale 原理</button>
    <button class="drawer-tab" data-tab="refs">📚 权威链接</button>
  </div>
  <div id="drawerContent"></div>
</div>

</body>
</html>